{"subject": "Return Authorization Request", "body": "Dear Customer Support Team,

I hope this message reaches you well. I am reaching out to inquire about the procedure for returning a recently purchased item from your store. Unfortunately, the product did not meet my expectations due to certain issues, and I would like to understand the steps involved in initiating a return.

Could you please provide comprehensive details regarding your return policy, including any deadlines, the conditions the product must satisfy, and whether specific documentation or original packaging needs to be included? Additionally, I would appreciate any further information needed."}
